WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.985
Two Ghana cedis 1 notes and one Ghana cedis 1 note make how many cedis? Let us think

00:00:05.985 --> 00:00:10.163
carefully. Add 1 plus 1 plus 1. The answer is 3. Great work!

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:16.719
Two Ghana cedis 2 notes and one Ghana cedis 2 note make how many cedis? Let us think

00:00:16.719 --> 00:00:20.825
carefully. Add 2 plus 2 plus 2. The answer is 6. Great work!

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:27.856
Two Ghana cedis 5 notes and one Ghana cedis 5 note make how many cedis? Let us think

00:00:27.856 --> 00:00:32.303
carefully. Add 5 plus 5 plus 5. The answer is 15. Great work!

00:00:33.117 --> 00:00:38.873
Two Ghana cedis 10 notes and one Ghana cedis 10 note make how many cedis? Let us

00:00:38.873 --> 00:00:43.613
think carefully. Add 10 plus 10 plus 10. The answer is 30. Great work!
